## Additional Rules

1. Test the live rendered experience, not source code alone.
2. Verify every automated candidate manually before reporting it.
3. Keep confirmed failures separate from advisory best practices.
4. Cite only criteria that actually apply; do not attach a generic WCAG citation.
5. Record inaccessible test infrastructure or missing credentials as coverage limits, not passes.
6. In report-only mode, do not edit source code or tests.
